sequenceDiagram
 participant OP as Operator
 participant API as Laravel API
 participant DB as MySQL 8.4 LTS
 participant Q as Queue
 participant AI as FastAPI
 participant UI as Dashboard
 OP->>API: Register unexpected Trip, start 14:35
 API->>DB: Commit event + audit + outbox
 API-->>OP: Accepted / event_id
 DB-->>Q: Reforecast requested
 Q->>DB: As-of approved sources + active model/plan
 Q->>AI: Predict on known data, scenarios if ETA unknown
 AI-->>Q: Product forecasts + metadata
 Q->>DB: Immutable new run + before/after impact
 Q-->>UI: Updated view + risk status
 OP->>API: ETA update / actual restart
 API->>DB: Immutable event revision
 DB-->>Q: New reforecast
